(text "PCB: 18 x 52 mm, 1.6 mm FR4, 2 layers, 70 um (2 oz) copper per layer." (at 30 110 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid c7f5fb25-5a11-5529-9169-528b0e6a481f))
(text "Two 3.2 mm NPTH mounting holes for M3 screws; mounting centres 42 mm." (at 30 117 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e33c626a-7bd3-5c1f-b1d7-153e8165c34d))
(text "7 mm diameter copper keepouts at mounting holes. Solid pad-to-plane connections." (at 30 124 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3e8374c3-222a-5934-9826-7d19bd8a62fc))
(text "Both layers: V+ left strip, GND fills remaining area. M3 screw keepouts remain copper-free." (at 30 131 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 48748a5f-3dc5-5b8d-89a8-409190d908f8))
